amazon_info = "Amazon constitutes a user–product review graph in which each edge represents a review posted by a user for a product. Each review includes vote counts indicating its helpfulness. Reviews with at least 10 votes are labeled normal if the ratio of helpful to total votes is 0.75 or higher, and anomalous if the ratio is 0.25 or lower."
